OL,3,ATrump and Xi come face-to-face as US
OL,4,Aand China battle to win the AI race
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Whoever wins AI, WINS!"
OL,8,FUS President Donald Trump has been
OL,9,Fblunt about his AI ambitions, as well
OL,10,Fas about who he considers the US's main
OL,11,Frival to be: China.
OL,13,FHis Chinese counterpart, Xi Jinping,
OL,14,Fhas not said anything so forthright -
OL,15,Fbut it seems he holds a similar view.
OL,17,F"China very much sees it as a race,
OL,18,Fthey very much think China should be
OL,19,Fthe leading force in AI - they see AI
OL,20,Fas a power maximiser," says Rebecca
OL,21,FArcesati, from the Mercator Institute
OL,22,Ffor China Studies.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
